     ***********  Welcome to ADVENTURE!!!! ***********                  
                                                                        
     In this ADVENTURE you will meet DWARVES, ORCS, a TROLL,            
     and various other inhabitants of THE GREAT CAVE. Remem-            
     ber, there's only an overworked CPU and disc drive to              
     help you, so don't get mad at some long response time              
     now and then. Good luck, happy hunting!!                           
                                                                        
